# United Airlines — Essentials of Management

## Website architecture & design blueprint

This is going to work beautifully as a hybrid, research-rich, interactive presentation website: a cinematic opening that feels like an aviation brand experience, followed by seven deeply developed chapters that feel like an interactive management case study.

The key design decision is that we will not force the report into a conventional slide deck. Each chapter will have its own narrative, sub-sections, evidence, visualizations, management analysis, and presentation-friendly navigation. The website should feel polished enough to explore independently, but structured enough that you can present it confidently in class.

